{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L0JvYiUyMExhemFyJTIwQXJlYSUyMDUxJTIwJTI2JTIwRmx5aW5nJTIwU2F1Y2VycyUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Bob Lazar Area 51 & Flying Saucers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9ibnQLtq3BUXQPEjOUsIhyDDvS8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHNF0C72wQzzJ5GVxNeHljHmpJu.jpg","description":"Area 51, flying saucers from another world - and the program to create a fierce technology. Bob Lazar remains the singular most famous and controversial name in the world of UFOs.  The reason you know about Area 51 is because Lazar came forward and told you about it. His disclosures have turned his life upside-down and he has tried to stay out of the spotlight. For this reason, he has never let any filmmaker into the private world of his daily life - that is - until now.  Corbell’s film explores Lazar’s claims through the lens of thirty years - providing rare and never before revealed footage - guaranteed to alter the landscape of the debate.\n\nRated 15 · Released 1 Nov 2018 · United States of America · Language: English · 97 min\nStudio: JKLC Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"97 min","cast":["Bob Lazar","George Knapp","Mickey Rourke","Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell","Joy White","Phyllis Tucker","Layne Keck","Mario Santa Cruz"],"director":["Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell"],"released":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/51cGe6zHRatkJhNyEw99JAjsIUv.jpg"},{"name":"Bob Lazar","character":"Self - Interviewee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f9RSED3ffAIFHuJIV3CzfomNP6L.jpg"},{"name":"George Knapp","character":"Self - Investigative Reporter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/htIYj9VDjlIvVfbR058EyJ64qoh.jpg"},{"name":"Mickey Rourke","character":"Self -